		"name": "SIH2026 - Tender Verification Platform API",
		"description": "# 🏛️ SIH 2026 - Tender Verification Platform API Documentation\n\nOfficial REST API Specification for both **Officer Module** (DigiLocker Identity Verification, Email OTP, JWT), **Bidder Module** (GSTIN & Government Verification, Email OTP, JWT Auth, Token Verification, Profile Management), **Tender Management** (Cloudinary uploads, DB persistence), and the **GeM ML Microservice v2.0.0** (13 consolidated production endpoints).\n\n### 🚀 Base URLs\n- **Spring Boot Backend (Local)**: `http://localhost:8080`\n- **Spring Boot Backend (Production Render)**: `https://sih2026-83r4.onrender.com`\n- **Python ML Microservice (Production Azure VM)**: `http://20.40.44.184`\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\n- Bearer Token in `Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>` header for protected endpoints.\n- Automated collection scripts capture tokens into `{{officer_token}}` and `{{bidder_token}}`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
